<!-- ============ TOOL 2: 3D Mesh Compare ============ -->
<section id="mesh-compare" class="py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-16 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Tool 2</span>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl after:mt-3 after:block after:h-0.5 after:w-12 after:bg-primary after:content-['']">3D Mesh Compare</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-xl opacity-80">How close is your reverse-engineered model to the scan it came from? Export the model as an STL, line it up with the scan data, and every point is coloured by its distance from the reference surface.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 mb-8">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Automatic best fit</strong> — tries several starting orientations, so a symmetric part doesn't end up upside down</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Tolerance colour map</strong> — green within tolerance, red for extra material, blue for missing; hover to read the deviation anywhere</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Section view</strong> — cut through the part and see the outline gap, magnified</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Pick a range on the histogram</strong> — everything else turns grey, so problem areas stand out</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Statistics by surface area</strong> — % in tolerance, mean, RMS, 95% band and histogram</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Branded HTML report</strong> — your logo and job details, ready to send to a client (<a class="link link-primary" href="/tools/demo-report/">see a demo report</a>)</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg><span><strong>Batch mode</strong> — run it from the command line for a pile of parts</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
          <a href="/tools/3d-mesh-compare/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">3D Mesh Compare guide</a>
          <a href="/tools/demo-report/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">View demo report</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/madjalapeno/3dmeshtools/archive/refs/heads/main.zip" class="link link-hover">Download</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        {% shot "09-compare-deviation.png", "Deviation colour map, statistics and histogram in 3D Mesh Compare", "Deviation map with statistics and histogram." %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="border-t border-base-content/15 pt-6">
        <span class="block font-mono text-3xl font-bold leading-none text-primary" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Load both</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 opacity-80">Open the reference (your model as an STL) and the scan — or drop both files on the window.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-base-content/15 pt-6">
        <span class="block font-mono text-3xl font-bold leading-none text-primary" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Align</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 opacity-80">One click for automatic best fit, or pick three matching point pairs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-base-content/15 pt-6">
        <span class="block font-mono text-3xl font-bold leading-none text-primary" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Inspect &amp; report</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 opacity-80">Read the deviation map, pin callouts, and export the HTML report or a CSV.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

